codex
The existing churn test exposed the intended downstream metric delta: with conservative first sight, the three-turn A/A/B sequence records two prefix changes (empty→A, then A→empty) instead of one. I’m updating that assertion deliberately because it assumed immediate lifting; the churn map stays measurement-only and is not used for authorization.
